@startuml
title P1 macOS authenticated UI data integration

actor User
component "SwiftUI shell\ncanonical labels + honest state" as Shell
component "MacIdentityAppComposition\nCreate / Join / recovery export" as Identity
component "MacCaptureAppComposition\nlocal capture + self-test" as Capture
component "MacPhaseOneAppComposition\npresentation mapping" as PhaseOne
component "OnboardingService\nprotected credential workflow" as Onboarding
component "PhaseOneDraftOutbox\ndurable idempotent operations" as Outbox
component "PhaseOneAppClient\nauthenticated frozen HTTP" as Client
database "CaptureMediaStore\nprivate WAV drafts" as MediaStore
database "draft-outbox-v1.json\nkeys + server references" as OutboxStore
database "Keychain\nnode + control capability" as Keychain
cloud "Coordinator\nidentity / media / transmission\npresence / history" as Coordinator

User --> Shell
Shell --> Identity : title / invite / explicit export
Identity --> Onboarding
Onboarding --> Keychain
Onboarding --> Coordinator : identity API

Shell --> Capture : microphone + local self-test
Capture --> MediaStore
Capture --> PhaseOne : finalized user_recording only
PhaseOne --> Outbox : attach / send / retry / delete
Outbox --> MediaStore : delete only after upload confirmation
Outbox --> OutboxStore : persist before network transitions
Outbox --> Client
Shell --> PhaseOne : refresh / history actions
PhaseOne --> Client
Client --> Keychain : canonical origin + control bearer
Client --> Coordinator : authenticated Phase 1 HTTP

note bottom of Capture
Disposable self-test is local-only.
It has no path to Client or Coordinator.
end note

note bottom of Client
Opaque IDs remain action handles.
The shell renders human targets and status.
end note
@enduml
